151	  // Discord bridge (Phase 1 mirror): best-effort. This reply was written from
152	  // the admin inbox, never from Discord (Discord-originated replies go through
153	  // app/api/webhooks/discord/route.ts, which calls writeChatReply directly and
154	  // does NOT mirror — otherwise a Discord reply would echo right back into the
